# rmdir(1)

## NAME

rmdir - remove empty directories

## SYNOPSIS

    rmdir [-p] directory...

## DESCRIPTION

Removes empty directories.

## OPTIONS

- `-p`: also remove each parent named in the path

## EXIT STATUS

- `0`: success
- `1`: an error occurred for some operand
- `2`: usage error

## SEE ALSO

mkdir(1), rm(1)
